  "$schema": "../spec.schema.json",
  "title": "Okta secures customer sign-up, sign-in and APIs",
  "description": "Customers sign up and sign in to a web store and a mobile app with Okta, with a passkey or a social account. Okta keeps customer profiles and consent in Universal Directory, blocks credential stuffing with ThreatInsight and issues ID and access tokens from an authorization server. The apps call the Orders API with the access token; the API checks the token's scopes and reads the orders database. Support agents unlock accounts and reset factors in Okta. Okta Workflows sends profile changes to the CRM, and the SIEM collects sign-in and admin events from the System Log.",
